<section id="our-story" class="py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-shadow">
      Why I built this
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold text-title sm:text-4xl">
      A game for my youngest son
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink/80">
      My youngest son loves video games — and puffer fish. He was starting
      to learn sight words in school, and the practice apps we tried felt
      like homework wearing a costume: ads, pop-ups, and characters that
      had nothing to do with what he actually loved. So I built him one
      that did — a game where a puffer fish he could root for was on the
      line, and getting a word right actually meant something.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink/80">
      He liked it enough to keep playing. That's Puffer Power.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
